    "body": "[M58Wx_Mall_halkskydd_durklucka.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/35069968/M58Wx_Mall_halkskydd_durklucka.zip)\nAttached: camcraft-2710-repro.zip\n- untitled2.camproj: the project. The STEP model is stored inside it. G54 is on the part corner.\n- The machine is grblHAL 3-axis with the X/Y travel set to -3000..3000 (saved in the project's setup).\n- CamCraft version: 0.24\n\n- To reproduce: open the project and post. The post is refused with 2D Contour1: move 31 reaches 21864.484 in X, the stroke is -3000.000..3000.000 and 40+ other travel problems. Expected after the fix: no travel problems. The real cut stays inside X -4..1128 and Y -4..822 from G54.\n",
